OL,3,GNEWSAHot school meals to be supplied by
OL,4,AUK company
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food company from the UK has been
OL,7,Fappointed to provide hot school meals
OL,8,Ffor government primary schools across
OL,9,FJersey.
OL,11,FEducation minister deputy Catherine
OL,12,FCurtis said she had signed a contract
OL,13,Fwith Apetito Limited to also provide
OL,14,Fmenu development, meal production,
OL,15,Fnutritional compliance and associated
OL,16,Fcatering services.
OL,18,FThe School Food Programme began as a
OL,19,Fpilot in 2019 in partnership with local
OL,20,Fcharity Caring Cooks and Apetito
OL,21,FLimited joined it in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
