OL,3,GNEWSAHot school meals to be supplied by
OL,4,AUK company
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the Wiltshire food
OL,7,Ffirm had been selected following an
OL,8,F"open and compliant" procurement
OL,9,Fprocess which had included evaluating
OL,10,Fquality, service delivery arrangements,
OL,11,Fsustainability and price.
